      "id": "2d09cb0b-d766-4b91-9043-80a46a15f08b"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": "Summary",
      "id": "8218dc0f-851e-4067-9580-8dcb7bb3355b"
    },
    {
      "type": "numberedListItem",
      "content": "Use a present form of hebben + a past participle for a completed activity.",
      "id": "c43db5cc-5e9e-4561-ac55-76d8f1f9da0d"
    },
    {
      "type": "numberedListItem",
      "content": "Put the participle at the end: Ik heb gisteren gewerkt.",
      "id": "589316dd-3c01-47d5-ad75-eed4957bf2c2"
    },
    {
      "type": "numberedListItem",
      "content": "The stem's final sound decides -t or -d: gewerkt, gemaakt, gebeld, geleerd.",
      "id": "c51aeafe-c0ef-42e9-b0ce-c7bc3e2c1629"
    },
    {
      "type": "numberedListItem",
      "content": "With a separable verb, ge goes between the prefix and the verb: opgeruimd.",
      "id": "483f487c-6bd4-437d-a56d-38f3cf78a266"
    }
  ],
